{"policyVersion":3,"items":[{"translations":{"en":["Sonic the Hedgehog: The Movie","When Dr. Eggman (Robotnik in the US version) holds the president and his daughter hostage, Sonic must comply to the evil scientist's demand of going to Eggmanland to stop Black Eggman and deactivate the city's generator before it reaches critical mass. Little does Sonic know that it's a trap to activate Hyper Metal Sonic, a robot counterpart built by Eggman to destroy our hero.\n\n\n\n(Source: Anime News Network)"],"ja":["ソニック★ザ★ヘッジホッグ",""]},"airedAt":null,"relations":[],"id":"mal-2263","ids":{"shikimori":2263,"mal":2263,"anilist":2263,"kodik":"serial-29804"},"kodikIds":["movie-61603","movie-44109","movie-47783","serial-29804"],"kodikRevisions":{"movie-61603":"2020-10-12T19:10:44Z","movie-44109":"2019-10-24T13:09:36Z","movie-47783":"2020-01-16T09:15:57Z","serial-29804":"2020-10-18T10:03:42Z"},"title":"Ёж Соник","originalTitle":"Sonikku za hejjihoggu","alt":"Sonic the Hedgehog / Sonic the Hedgehog: The Movie","description":"Отдых Соника и Тейлза прерывает тревожащая новость: доктор Эггман взял в заложники дочь президента. Теперь по требованию злодея им предстоит отправиться в Эггманлэнд и остановить Тёмного Эггмана, его роботизированную версию, и предотвратить взрыв вышедшего из-под контроля генератора, который может уничтожить всю планету.","year":1996,"type":"OVA","genres":["Приключения","Комедия","Фантастика","антропоморфизм"],"rating":6.97,"popularity":0,"ongoing":false,"relatedMalIds":[],"artwork":{"poster":{"url":"https://shikimori.io/uploads/poster/animes/2263/29d17cf727678a750723269f438e2638.jpeg","width":374,"height":600},"backdrop":{"url":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/2263-wtVZBlbDYEv1.jpg","width":1900,"height":400}},"releasedEpisodes":[1,2],"episodes":[{"number":1,"ordinal":1,"season":1,"audio":[{"id":"kodik-704","dubId":"704","label":"Дублированный","language":"ru","original":false,"duration":null,"sources":[],"subtitles":[],"opening":null,"end